  ],
  "briefing_dialog": [
    {
      "speaker": "Principal",
      "text": "Kai is missing."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Principal",
      "text": "He left for Makara six hours after the seal in the inner chamber broke. Took two team members and a comm channel. The team came back. He didn't."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Principal",
      "text": "We're not assuming anything yet. He could be alive. He could have lost his bearings inside the structure that's now open. He could have followed something in."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Dr. Carlo",
      "text": "The ruins are still there. So is whatever was sealed. If he went deeper, he went into something we don't have a name for."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Principal",
      "text": "Find him. Bring him back if you can."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Principal",
      "text": "And if you can't... bring back the truth."
    }
  ],
